      <title>拆解1.1万DeepSeek Harness插件后发现官方零治理</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260902/%E6%8B%86%E8%A7%A31.1%E4%B8%87DeepSeek-Harness%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E9%9B%B6%E6%B2%BB%E7%90%86/</link>
